# Resolved ASL documents, regenerated by extract-asl.mjs on every
# `pnpm --filter @infra test:sfn-local`. They are build output, not source:
# committing one means a stale copy drifts from the stack it came from.
#
# Deliberately a GLOB — a per-file list silently misses the next state machine
# added to the suite (which is exactly how image-process.asl.json ended up
# tracked).
*.asl.json
